WEBVTT

00:00:00.114 --> 00:00:10.050
What if attendance was already marked? This video shows how to reopen it on your phone, correct a status, and save without creating duplicates.

00:00:11.730 --> 00:00:18.786
Tap the menu button at the top left, open Attendance, and then tap 1. Manual Entry.

00:00:19.838 --> 00:00:27.518
Choose the same class and the same date that you marked before. The students appear with the statuses that were saved.

00:00:36.864 --> 00:00:45.696
A blue notice says that attendance records already exist for this date. Saving will update them, so nothing is created twice.

00:00:46.211 --> 00:00:57.227
Tap a student's letter to correct it. Fatima Noor was marked A for absent, and one tap changes her to L for leave. The count now shows 1 Leave.

00:01:03.243 --> 00:01:14.499
Scroll down and tap Save Attendance. The message says Saved, 0 created, 4 updated. The old records were changed, and none were duplicated.

00:01:21.710 --> 00:01:26.342
The correction is saved. Nothing was duplicated.
